- action(n1, "start"): The phrase "To start" in the source text indicates the beginning of the process flow and does not represent a distinct, executable action (SMC1, SMC2).
- action(n4, "end process"), action(n7, "end process"), action(n10, "end process"), action(n11, "end process"): The source text "the process will end" signifies the termination of the process (which is correctly modeled by end nodes e1, e2, e3, e4), not separate tasks to be performed (SMC1, SMC2).